    "description": "# napari-aigifmaker\n\nTurn text into animated GIFs with AI GIF Maker. Native GIF generation \u2014 no video conversion. Type what you want and download your GIF in about a minute.\n\nThis napari plugin adds an **AI GIF Maker** dock widget inside your viewer: enter a prompt and an optional `AIGIFMAKER_API_KEY`, press **Generate GIF**, and load the animated GIF frame stack directly as a napari image layer (with the source URL stored in `layer.metadata[\"aigifmaker_url\"]`).\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\npip install napari-aigifmaker\n```\n\nOr install inside napari via **Plugins -> Install/Uninstall Plugins**.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Create an API key at [AI GIF Maker API Keys](https://aigifmaker.ai/settings/apikeys) or try the anonymous allowance.\n2. Open **Plugins -> napari-aigifmaker -> AI GIF Maker** in napari.\n3. Describe the motion and scene, click **Generate GIF**, and scrub through the returned frames along axis 0.\n\nUseful links:\n- [AI GIF Maker](https://aigifmaker.ai/?utm_source=napari&utm_medium=package)\n- [Documentation](https://aigifmaker.readthedocs.io/en/latest/)\n- [Pricing & Credits](https://aigifmaker.ai/pricing?utm_source=napari&utm_medium=package)\n",
